      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.40 (vs ₹0.02 loss in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.40 (up from ₹0.02 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹9.16m (down 53% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹8.20m (up ₹8.52m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 90% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 57% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 17% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
